  message: "Merged as PR #2264. 'ci-debug trace [workflow]' (scripts/scheduled-trace; ci-debug trace + pr-of). Known answers, outputs in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/trace/known_*.txt: (1) 11-16 full suite, range c88002f1..425477b6 (271 commits; last green found by walking ci-debug cron-status): the five test-only-reachability callables -> de84ccde1c/20772527dc (PR #2198), e46e89a9a8 (#2168), af2f345dd2 (#2189), d5c1c31fd4 (#2190), 7a8ccdf094 (#2163); tests/test_measure_go_import_versioning.py -> 0bedb1624b (#2151), arm 'scheduled environment'; tests/test_smart_test_loadgroup.py -> d0e8adfa45 (#2136), 'scheduled environment' (pytest was 9.2.0 at the green run too: the new test, not a dependency release, is what changed). (2) nightly 3.10 leg, b0df778e..3da1f85b: test_py_annotation_rendering.py -> f8161537ab (#2183). (3) 11-18 from the published verdicts (533011328 from fc2d2d8a9): shared_context -> 0ec2953c4 (#2249) among 4 commits; test_kept_work_contexts.py -> fe1af591e0 (#2253). All four causes of 11-16 named. Tests: tests/test_scheduled_trace.py, 20, an arm each plus parsing and the command; 9 mutations (manifest check, deselect lines, env arm, code arm, gate by name, coverage blame, version compare, bracket ids, green-must-pass) each turn a test red. GAP: no red scheduled run with a coverage gap exists in the published history; that arm is tested on a constructed repository only (not in the smart-test bed). INV-libib (matrix-leg logs) not addressed: a nightly leg's log is fetched by step name and may fail."  # ae3c
